# The desktop system's own tools: the shell and its plugins, theme sync, capture, input methods,
# printing, the screensaver and the commands in desktop/system. Each is something those
# commands or the shell call. Packages only the hardware repository builds (its titlebars,
# screenshot tool, wallpaper engine and fonts) come from it; it is listed after every other
# repository, so it never replaces a package they carry.

